- **manifold in node:** run scratch scripts as `.mts` (top-level await), import `manifold-3d/manifold.js` by path, and call `setup()` after `Module()`. In the browser, `csg.ts` passes `locateFile` the `?url` of `manifold-3d/manifold.wasm`, which needs `vite-env.d.ts` for the `?url` type.
